## Protocol Specifications

### Zcash Orchard Protocol

-   **Spec:** https://zips.z.cash/protocol/protocol.pdf (Section 5)
-   **ZIP-224:** https://zips.z.cash/zip-0224 (Orchard Shielded Protocol)
-   **Implementation:** https://github.com/zcash/orchard
-   Modern design with unified "Action" transfers

### Zcash Sapling Protocol

-   **Spec:** https://zips.z.cash/protocol/protocol.pdf (Section 4)
-   **ZIP-32:** https://zips.z.cash/zip-0032 (Key Derivation)
-   **Implementation:** https://github.com/zcash/librustzcash
-   Proven design, separate Spend/Output descriptions

### Zcash Wallet Implementations (Reference)

-   **Zashi iOS (ECC)**: https://github.com/Electric-Coin-Company/zashi-ios
-   **Zashi Android (ECC)**: https://github.com/Electric-Coin-Company/zashi-android

### Namada MASP

-   **Docs:** https://docs.namada.net/users/shielded-transfers
-   **Implementation:** https://github.com/anoma/masp
-   **Spec:** https://specs.namada.net/modules/masp
-   Multi-asset shielded pool architecture

### Tachyon (Zcash Upgrade)

-   **Blog:** https://seanbowe.com/blog/tachyon-scaling-zcash-oblivious-synchronization/
-   **Author:** Sean Bowe (Electric Coin Company)
-   Key concepts:
    -   Oblivious synchronization (clients sync without revealing addresses)
    -   Privacy-preserving throughput improvements

