## Toolchain

### Noir + UltraPlonk

```bash
# Install (UltraPlonk-compatible versions)
noirup -v v1.0.0-beta.3
bbup  # bb 0.82.2

# UltraPlonk commands (note: OLD_API)
bb OLD_API prove -b target/circuit.json -w target/witness.gz -o proof.bin
bb OLD_API write_vk -b target/circuit.json -o vk.bin
bb OLD_API verify -p ./proof.bin -k ./vk.bin
```

### Solana

```bash
# Build program
cd programs/solana-masp
cargo build-sbf

# Deploy
solana program deploy target/deploy/solana_masp.so --url http://127.0.0.1:8899
```

### Circom (for reference, used in sapling-groth16)

```bash
# The sapling-groth16 spike uses Circom + snarkjs/rapidsnark
# See ../sapling-groth16/README.md for setup
```

